OL,3,GNEWSABravery award for police who faced
OL,4,Aarmed burglars                         
OL,6,FTwo police officers who confronted     
OL,7,Farmed burglars during a break-in at a  
OL,8,FWolverhampton pub have been recognised 
OL,9,Ffor their bravery.                     
OL,11,FSgt Steve Wellington and PC Roman      
OL,12,FHutchings were awarded a Commander's   
OL,13,FCommendation after detaining the       
OL,14,Fsuspects who were armed with hammers   
OL,15,Fand chisels while targeting the        
OL,16,Fpremises' gaming machines.             
OL,18,FThe officers were on patrol in         
OL,19,FWednesfield on 9 July 2025 when they   
OL,20,Fspotted a car linked to pub burglaries 
OL,21,Fand a high-speed pursuit the previous  
OL,22,Fnight.                                 
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
