OL,3,GNEWSABravery award for police who faced
OL,4,Aarmed burglars                         
OL,6,FAfter blocking in the vehicle outside  
OL,7,Fthe pub, they discovered the premises  
OL,8,Fhad been broken into and went inside,  
OL,9,Fwhere they encountered two masked men. 
